=Cannon Tower=
*Based on [[units/turrets/Cannon|Cannon]] turret
*  Health: 22 [=11*2 (turret health multiplier)]
*  Price: %Minerals% 55
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 3 [=5-2 (tower modifier)]
*  [[concepts/attack range|Hrz. Attack range]]: 7 [=5+2 (bonus)] (Artillery)
*  Does not require ammunition
*  2 attacks per round
*  Explosion radius: 1
*  Damage: 7
This tower-turret type can attack objects in range.
